		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead, rotten horse oozing decay. Stinks of death.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 12, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +3 (1d8 + disease) and 1 hooves +3 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Disease</strong>. CON 12+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON, rise as plagued beast or zombie at midnight.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
